#![enable(implicit_some)]
// What each spell does to each body it lands on, in order; the spells are
// named as `SpellId` names them, in the order of their numbers.
//
// A row lists only what is not the default: it lands on `Everyone`, rolls
// nothing, always happens, allows no save and is not resisted.
//   kind         what it does (default: Harm)
//   on           Everyone | Members | Monsters | Party (the party as a whole)
//   roll         how its magnitude is rolled
//   chance       the percent chance it happens at all
//   save         the base of the save the body may make against it
//   spell_realm  the body resists it, and saves, in the spell's own realm
//   half         saved against and resisted at half strength
//   landed       only if the row before it landed
//   resisted     only if the row before it was resisted
//   kinds        only these kinds of monster
// Spell... kinds and rolls take what they name from the spell's own record:
// SpellDice its dice, SpellRounds its duration, SpellEnchant itself.
// leeches: the damage it deals comes back to its caster, as health (true)
// or as spell points (false).
{
    ACID_SPLASH: (
        effects: [
            (roll: SpellDice, spell_realm: true),
        ],
    ),
    BLESS: (
        effects: [
            (kind: SpellEnchant, on: Monsters, roll: SpellRounds),
            (kind: SpellEnchant, on: Party, roll: SpellRounds),
        ],
    ),
    FROST: (
        effects: [
            (roll: SpellDice, spell_realm: true),
        ],
    ),
